      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s13-t03-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "不同类型独立尝试至少成功一次，仍可乘各自失败率后取反。"
        }
      ],
